Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My new flat is in the yellow house
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,by the big square in Uptown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye for now.
